addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHISHI, KATSUMI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TOYOSHIMA, MASAKATSU</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An information distribution system comprises a central station (100) which includes an audience information processing section (114) and distributes digital multichannel service signals through a first transmission path (200); a plurality of network stations (300, 340) that receive digital multichannel service signals distributed by the central station using reception means (310, 320, 330), convert the received digital multichannel signals into digital multichannel service signals for a second transmission path (400) using modulation/conversion means, and send them to the network (400); and a plurality of receiving terminals (500) which receive digital multichannel service signals distributed by the network station. The receiving terminals (500) record the received audience information and send the information to the audience information processing section (114) in central station (100).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention porte sur un système de distribution d'informations comportant: une station centrale (100) comprenant une section de traitement d'informations d'audience (114) et répartissant des signaux numériques de services sur canaux multiples via une première voie de transmission (200); un ensemble de stations de réseau (340, 300) recevant des signaux numériques de services sur canaux multiples répartis par la station centrale à l'aide de moyens de réception (310, 320, 330), les convertissent en signaux numériques de services sur canaux multiples destinés à une deuxième voie de transmission (400) à l'aide de moyens de modulation/conversion, puis les transmettent au réseau (400). L'invention porte également sur un ensemble de terminaux de réception (500) recevant les signaux numériques de services sur canaux multiples répartis par la station du réseau. Les terminaux de réception (500) enregistrent les informations d'audience reçues et les transmettent à la section de traitement d'informations d'audience (114) de la station centrale (100).</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>